 README.md                           |   1 +
 autotests/read/iff/sv5_unc_deep.iff | Bin 0 -> 53762 bytes
 autotests/read/iff/sv5_unc_deep.png | Bin 0 -> 6809 bytes
 src/imageformats/chunks.cpp         | 512 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/imageformats/chunks_p.h         | 289 +++++++++++++++-
 src/imageformats/iff.cpp            |  67 ++++
 src/imageformats/iff_p.h            |   2 +
 7 files changed, 867 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 autotests/read/iff/sv5_unc_deep.iff
 create mode 100644 autotests/read/iff/sv5_unc_deep.png

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index a42a642..ee08f9c 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -403,6 +403,7 @@ The plugin supports the following image data:
 - FORM IMAG (Compact Disc-Interactive): It supports CLut4, CLut7, CLut8, Rle7
   and DYuv formats.
 - FORM RGFX: It supports uncompressed images only.
+- FORM DEEP: It supports uncompressed, RLE and TVDC images.
 - FOR4 CIMG (Maya Image File Format): It supports 24/48-bit RGB and 32/64-bit 
   RGBA images.
 
diff --git a/autotests/read/iff/sv5_unc_deep.iff b/autotests/read/iff/sv5_unc_deep.iff
